<title>SWEDEN: Trading in Trygg-Hansa to resume 1030 GMT.</title>
<headline>Trading in Trygg-Hansa to resume 1030 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stockholm bourse said on Thursday trading in shares of insurer Trygg-Hansa would resume at 1030 GMT.</p>
<p>Trading in Trygg-Hansa shares was suspended before the market opened on Thursday ahead of the company announcing a two billion crown buy back of its B-series shares.</p>
<p>The stock last traded at 156 crowns on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
